V6 Changes - 25/10/2026

SkyXBack 1.0.0
- /back = last death (not spawn). SimpleTpa /back disabled and SkyXBack re-registers /back after ServerLoadEvent.
- 3s teleport delay + 10s cooldown; allow-bypass: false (ops can no longer spam).
- English messages.

SkyXCrafts 1.0.0
- 82 active entries: 76 ItemsAdder recipes (crafting table shaped/shapeless, anvil, cooking) + 6 item sources.
- Categories: Crafting Table (58), Cooking (1), Anvil (17), Mob Drops (1), Block Drops (2), Farming (3), All (82).
- Sources: creeper -> blankdiscfrag (13%), ruby ore -> ruby, wet pot -> dry pot, CustomCrops Arcanite Plant -> arcanite seeds (90%), arcanite berry (40%), arcanite nugget (9%).
- Chat search: case/color/accent insensitive, partial matching (a = all with a, arca = all arcanite), global search, real item display names.
- Clear search button, cancel in chat, pagination, back to categories/list.
- loots.mobs/loots.blocks and CustomCrops/contents/crops/*.yml read automatically; extra-sources config for fishing/other.
- /crafts search <query> for quick testing.
- RvCustomRecipies disabled (19 recipes were ItemsAdder duplicates).

SkyXPlayerSync 1.3.2 + MIB
- Fixed fast craft/clear inventory + shift-click dupe: MONITOR un-cancel for creative clicks, player-inventory shift-clicks and vanilla container shift-clicks (chest, trapped chest, barrel, shulker, ender chest, hopper, furnace, dispenser, dropper, brewing stand, etc.); custom GUIs/shops are excluded; MIB click blocker removed; 3s join lock; validated in creative (vanilla + custom + relog), survival player inventory and vanilla containers (25/10); context: after 1.21.11 update.
- MIB = inventory + armor. SkyXPlayerSync = gamemode, enderchest, XP, effects, health, food, saturation.
- Synchronous save on quit, loaded gate, 5 join retries, data validation, enderchest 27/54, COALESCE fallback.
- English error messages, /playersync status, tab completer.
- MIB error messages clarified in English.

Infra V6
- Survival RCON: 192.168.1.1:25598 (password survivalv4*). 25587 = ItemsAdder.
- SeasonVault preserved (vault.db + slot permissions).
- Borders: world/nether/end 20000, mining 14000, hub 500, parkour 370.
- Maintenance proxy ON; opening planned early January 2027; launch-s6.sh requires OPEN.
- Shift-click dupe: MIB `InventoryClick` listener removed by SkyXPlayerSync 1.3.2; ia.admin.iaget restored to true for iiXPaladiumyXii (DB value=1); MIB saveDataTask disabled (inventory still saved on quit); 3s join click lock. 1.3.2 un-cancels creative + survival player-inventory + vanilla container shift clicks; custom GUIs/shops excluded.
- MIB cancels inventory clicks during its initial sync (2-3s after join); wait before moving items.

